<body lang=3Den style=3D'font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;border-width:100%'>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:0in;margin-left:0in;width:9.677in'>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:0in;margin-left:0in;width:4.352in'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:"Calibri Light";font-size:20.0pt'>Warden=
 Iset Nour</p>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:.0409in;margin-left:0in;width:1.9472=
in'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.0pt;color:#767676'>=
Monday 9 March 2026</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.0pt;color:#767676'>=
14:14</p>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:.4326in;margin-left:0in;width:9.677i=
n'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt'><span style=3D=
'font-family:Calibri'>Keeper of the eastern gate, and the only person the C=
ouncil trusts with a key to the Sunken Archive's dry stair. Answers only to=
 the Council, never to the garrison commander.</span></p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;border-width:100%'>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:0in;margin-left:0in;width:9.677in'>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:0in;margin-left:0in;width:4.352in'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:"Calibri Light";font-size:20.0pt'>The Su=
nken Archive</p>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:.0409in;margin-left:0in;width:1.9472=
in'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.0pt;color:#767676'>=
Thursday 12 March 2026</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.0pt;color:#767676'>=
18:27</p>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:.4326in;margin-left:0in;width:9.677i=
n'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt'><span style=3D=
'font-family:Calibri'>A flooded lower level of the old library, accessible =
only at low tide. The Council seals the main doors between tides to keep lo=
oters out, and the one dry stair down is a secret kept by whoever wardens t=
he eastern gate.</span></p>

<img width=3D16 height=3D16 src=3D"Handouts_file/image001.png">

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;border-width:100%'>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:0in;margin-left:0in;width:9.677in'>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:0in;margin-left:0in;width:4.352in'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:"Calibri Light";font-size:20.0pt'>Floode=
d Stacks</p>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:.0409in;margin-left:0in;width:1.9472=
in'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.0pt;color:#767676'>=
Friday 13 March 2026</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.0pt;color:#767676'>=
09:02</p>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:.4326in;margin-left:0in;width:9.677i=
n'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt'><span style=3D=
'font-family:Calibri'>The lower archive floods every spring tide, and the l=
owest shelves stay permanently underwater. Careful readers wade in at low t=
ide to pull waterlogged ledgers before they rot for good.</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt'><span style=3D=
'font-family:Calibri'>Watched over by <a href=3D"onenote:#Warden Iset Nour&=
amp;section-id=3D{A7D363BC-44BD-4D13-87C9-3B954896A70C}&amp;page-id=3D{3E7F=
4879-F021-4EA9-A4EC-2CF61598795B}&amp;end">Warden Iset Nour</a>, who keeps =
the one dry stair a secret from anyone she has not vetted herself.</span></=
p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

